00:14:15,591 --> 00:14:21,103
shoyn. un di froy hob ikh shoyn nisht mer getrofn mer gezen.

200
00:14:23,438 --> 00:14:25,946
un vi lang zaynt ir geven,

201
00:14:25,632 --> 00:14:27,026
in Lodzh?

202
00:14:26,863 --> 00:14:27,920
Oyshvits?

203
00:14:28,163 --> 00:14:31,194
in Oyshvits efsher finef biz zeks vokhn.

204
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,544
knape zeks vokhn.

205
00:14:33,124 --> 00:14:37,016
ir z- ir zaynt geven mit andere mentshn fun Lodzh?

206
00:14:37,461 --> 00:14:42,753
fun Lodzh, ikh hob mikh getrofn mit mit mentshn farshidene.

207
00:14:43,502 --> 00:14:47,326
un vos ven ir zaynt geven in Oyshvits,

208
00:14:47,383 --> 00:14:49,891
vos hot ir dortn gezen?

209
00:14:51,687 --> 00:14:58,211
ikh hob gehat a fraynt, a fraynt vos ikh hob geshribn di g- di Khurbn Lodzh.

210
00:14:58,656 --> 00:15:02,568
Khurbn Lodzh hob ikh aleyn ongeshribn. er hot geshribn di

211
00:15:02,568 --> 00:15:06,550
di di numern mit di tsifern mit di rekhnikes,

212
00:15:06,550 --> 00:15:12,625
un ikh hob geshribn di di spetsifishe, di politishe lage.

213
00:15:12,625 --> 00:15:16,386
un un di di ale zakhn vos zenen forgekumen.

214
00:15:16,527 --> 00:15:20,823
BUT Lodzh hot nisht gemakht far oyf mir keyn shum,

215
00:15:20,880 --> 00:15:24,890
m'hot nisht gezen vi m'harget di yidn.

216
00:15:26,263 --> 00:15:28,855
in Oyshvi- ir ir hot dos gezen?

217
00:15:28,828 --> 00:15:30,779
in Oyshvits oykh nisht.

218
00:15:31,107 --> 00:15:34,071
m'hot gezen di barakn di di ge-

219
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:42,106
di di di gebaydes vu m'firt arayn di mentshn un un dortn farsamt men zey un dort farbrent men.

220
00:15:42,106 --> 00:15:46,187
di royekh iz aroysgeganen fun dem fun dem fayer-oyvn.

221
00:15:46,969 --> 00:15:48,617
der gedikhter royekh.

222
00:15:50,310 --> 00:15:57,594
vos iz geven dem nomen fun ayer fraynt vos hot ongeshribn ongeshribn dem bukh fun Lodzh?

223
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:01,189
vi heyst ayer fraynt?

224
00:16:01,127 --> 00:16:05,762
Tabeksblat. Yisroel Tabeksblat.

225
00:16:06,274 --> 00:16:09,474
un ir zaynt durkhgekumen Oyshvits mit im?

226
00:16:09,615 --> 00:16:16,983
yo, neyn, ikh bin, m'hot mikh gekhapt in a veg. ikh bin geganen tsurik in mayn barak arayn.

227
00:16:17,648 --> 00:16:21,371
"hey, yunger!" er hot mir gerufn.

228
00:16:23,014 --> 00:16:27,108
"kenstu bist a bistu a vorkman?"

229
00:16:27,182 --> 00:16:34,449
dos heyst az ikh verk az ikh arbet. yo, zog ikh, ikh bin a klepner. un ikh bin a roy-shloser.

230
00:16:34,945 --> 00:16:36,559
got hot gekumen.

231
00:16:37,712 --> 00:16:40,704
er hot mikh shoyn genumen, mir shoyn gegebn a hemd.

232
00:16:40,704 --> 00:16:46,138
un shoyn gefirt in mikve arayn, in di bod arayn, un m'hot mir gegebn dos ontsutun.

233
00:16:46,138 --> 00:16:49,429
un ikh bin shoyn geven a a mitforer.

234
00:16:49,429 --> 00:16:57,753
gekrign dernokh a breytl aza breytl, mit a shtikl vursht un a shtikl margarin. dos breytl.

235
00:17:00,983 --> 00:17:03,322
dos hob ikh gegesn finef tog.

236
00:17:05,353 --> 00:17:07,152
fun eyn shtikl broyt?

237
00:17:07,665 --> 00:17:09,059
fun eyn breytl.

238
00:17:10,348 --> 00:17:12,772
ikh hob nisht keyn sakh gegesn, vayl

239
00:17:15,359 --> 00:17:21,243
ikh hob zikh nor gehaltn vayl ikh ikh darf nisht keyn sakh. ikh bin azoy gevoynt.

240
00:17:24,102 --> 00:17:26,779
un vos nokh hot ir geton in AUSCHWITZ?

241
00:17:26,666 --> 00:17:32,803
in Oyshvits gornisht, ikh hob gezukht, a mol hob ikh gefunen epes tsu esn, a mol nisht.

242
00:17:33,518 --> 00:17:37,865
un ikh bin geganen, keyner hot mikh nisht gekent. mayn best fraynt,

243
00:17:38,698 --> 00:17:41,949
hob ikh hot mikh shoyn nisht gekent.

244
00:17:42,816 --> 00:17:43,873
far vos?

245
00:17:43,626 --> 00:17:48,052
vayl m'hot im arayngenumen m'hot im arayngegebn in a

246
00:17:48,052 --> 00:17:51,061
un er iz in di UNK oder vos.

247
00:17:51,422 --> 00:17:57,322
m'hot mikh ikh bin gevezn ikh bin azoy geshtanen un geredt tsu mit aleyn.

248
00:17:57,852 --> 00:17:59,770
far vos kumt mir dos?

249
00:17:59,826 --> 00:18:08,319
derfar vayl vayl ikh hob avek hob gearbet ekstre in di di in dem Zinskevoler geto?

250
00:18:08,319 --> 00:18:11,458
un avekgegebn a teyl fun mayn fardinst

251
00:18:11,458 --> 00:18:17,606
a- avekgegebn far far far khav- khaveyrim, noente, kranke?

252
00:18:20,194 --> 00:18:26,077
ober ikh hob zikh gut oysgeveynt un tsurikgeganen. ikh bin geganen tsurik hot men mir untergekhapt.

253
00:18:27,265 --> 00:18:29,031
mikh gekhapt avektsushikn.

254
00:18:30,437 --> 00:18:32,135
ver hot aykh gekhapt?

255
00:18:32,496 --> 00:18:33,738
di daytshn.

256
00:18:34,808 --> 00:18:36,202
un vu hobn zey,

257
00:18:35,567 --> 00:18:39,054
"hey yunger!" az m'geyt nisht krigt men bald UNK.

258
00:18:41,929 --> 00:18:44,454
un vu hot men aykh avekgeshikt?

259
00:18:44,713 --> 00:18:52,605
demolt hot men mikh avekgeshikt, m'hot mikh avekgef- geshikt nokh in di in Alt-Daytshland.

260
00:18:54,012 --> 00:18:56,284
un un dan bin ikh

261
00:18:56,577 --> 00:19:01,481
un zikh oykh gekrign tsehakt, der gantser kop iz geven ge- farblutikt.

262
00:19:01,555 --> 00:19:04,333
vi azoy zaynt ir ongekumen ahin?

263
00:19:05,841 --> 00:19:06,729
vi?

264
00:19:06,330 --> 00:19:12,095
vi azoy zaynt ir ongekumen ahin, keyn Ayl- Alt-Daytshland?

265
00:19:12,743 --> 00:19:14,880
nokh Alt-Da- m'hot mikh ahingeshikt.

266
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:16,264
mit a ban?

267
00:19:16,050 --> 00:19:17,579
mit a ban, yo.

268
00:19:17,434 --> 00:19:20,567
vos hot ir getrakht ven ir zaynt geven oyfn ban?

269
00:19:19,712 --> 00:19:22,541
vos ikh hob gehat tsu trakhtn? ikh hob gornisht getrakht.

270
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:25,613
mit vemen zaynt ir geven, mit khaveyrim?

271
00:19:26,040 --> 00:19:32,447
m'iz geforn finef hundert mentshn. zenen aropgeganen oyf finef pletser.

272
00:19:32,706 --> 00:19:35,349
undz ze'mir geforn tsum fiftn plats.

273
00:19:36,368 --> 00:19:41,289
azoy in di ferd vagonen. nisht in di banen vu mentshn forn.

274
00:19:41,346 --> 00:19:48,934
nisht keyn be- nisht keyn ort vu tsu zitsn, vu tsi shteyn, oder anidertsuleygn epes. gornisht gornisht.

275
00:19:50,256 --> 00:19:52,157
azoy vi di ferd vagonen.

276
00:19:53,445 --> 00:19:54,977
un az s'hot zikh op-

277
00:19:54,977 --> 00:20:01,235
un az es hot zikh opgeshtelt dem vagon, vu zaynt ir geven?

278
00:20:01,140 --> 00:20:02,366
in vagon.

279
00:20:02,794 --> 00:20:04,661
ober s'hot zikh opgeshtelt?

280
00:20:04,633 --> 00:20:08,694
yo. hot zikh opgeshtelt, m'hot aropgelozt, m'hot gemakht a,

281
00:20:09,983 --> 00:20:11,985
un dernokh iz men vayter geforn.

282
00:20:12,885 --> 00:20:16,439
un biz vanen zaynt ir geforn?

283
00:20:16,783 --> 00:20:19,072
biz m'hot undz geheysn aropgeyn.

284
00:20:19,197 --> 00:20:20,946
un vu iz dos geven?

285
00:20:21,019 --> 00:20:22,532
iz gornisht geven.

286
00:20:22,977 --> 00:20:27,881
gornisht, m'hot nisht gehat tsu esn, m'hot nisht gehat keyn kokh, m'hot nisht gehat vu arayntsugeyn.

287
00:20:27,904 --> 00:20:31,073
m'iz in gantsn gornisht gevezn. tsu morgns

288
00:20:31,073 --> 00:20:35,132
iz ersht gekumen di di bazetsung undzere,

289
00:20:35,132 --> 00:20:41,229
a ga- draysik man iz gevezn a t- a fun a koze fun a tfise.

290
00:20:41,961 --> 00:20:45,212
zenen zey geganen, zey zenen geven farbrekhers,

291
00:20:45,893 --> 00:20:52,772
normal zey hobn geven a seks- SOME dos do homoseksualistn.

292
00:20:53,419 --> 00:20:56,298
zenen geven falshe gelt dreyers,

293
00:20:56,305 --> 00:20:59,370
un zey zenen antlofn di ershte,

294
00:21:00,034 --> 00:21:03,836
az zey hobn gevust di nayes az zenen

295
00:21:03,836 --> 00:21:06,221
zenen nisht do lang ekzistirn.

296
00:21:07,915 --> 00:21:11,942
iz men geven akht khadoshim, hobn zey antlofn.

297
00:21:13,230 --> 00:21:18,168
zenen ale eyntsikvayz antlofn. eyn tog iz avek dray, eyn tog akht,

298
00:21:18,225 --> 00:21:24,091
eyn tog, m'hot gevu -vust s- simonim az az s'endikt zikh.

299
00:21:25,465 --> 00:21:26,724
ikh farshtey.

300
00:21:27,692 --> 00:21:30,419
ir zaynt geven in a vald?

301
00:21:30,544 --> 00:21:33,018
neyn, mir zenen geven in barakn.

302
00:21:33,345 --> 00:21:41,067
s'dort geven a mol tsurik farshidene yorn tsurik an an anderer lager. ikh veys.

303
00:21:42,492 --> 00:21:44,241
azoy hot men gelebt.

304
00:21:44,888 --> 00:21:47,312
vos hot ir geton in dem lager?

305
00:21:47,554 --> 00:21:51,429
in dem lager hob ikh tsu ersht hob ikh getun zeyer a shver arbet.

306
00:21:51,570 --> 00:21:55,718
ikh veys nisht oyb ir vet visn dem taytsh vagonetkes.

307
00:21:55,718 --> 00:21:59,242
dos heyst kleyne oy- kleyne bandlekh,

308
00:21:59,788 --> 00:22:05,874
iz nor on a on a motor, un on a firung, gornisht mer vi

309
00:22:05,982 --> 00:22:10,448
azelkhene ofene bandlekh kleyne.

310
00:22:11,213 --> 00:22:17,706
un di m'hot ongefirt, ikh hob gemuzt mit a d- mit a drong fun a holts

311
00:22:17,706 --> 00:22:23,739
hob ikh gefirt di dos dos zol nisht arop fun di fun di f- fun di reder,

312
00:22:23,739 --> 00:22:29,060
az nisht hob ikh mikh tseklapt, oder ikh hob mikh toyt gemakht, oder m'hot mikh tseklapt.

313
00:22:29,657 --> 00:22:34,528
un nor vayl ikh hob gehat shtarke hent, hob ikh dos gehaltn fest

314
00:22:34,821 --> 00:22:38,477
fest, un m'hot un hintn hob ikh gehat fir shtupers.

315
00:22:40,086 --> 00:22:43,472
un zey hobn mikh geshtupt un azoy hob ikh gefirt di ban.

316
00:22:44,153 --> 00:22:47,353
vi lang hot ir gearbet in di melokhe.

317
00:22:46,465 --> 00:22:52,989
tsu finef vo- finef, neyn, mer, bay akht nayn vokhn

318
00:22:54,784 --> 00:22:59,520
hob ikh gearbet bay dem un ikh hob gekrign, azoy vi s'gekumen a komisye

319
00:22:59,897 --> 00:23:04,177
un er hot mikh bashtetikt az ikh ze tsu shlekht oys

320
00:23:04,302 --> 00:23:11,231
un ikh muz geyn opruen un vifl ikh hob gegat ACCIDENTS,

321
00:23:11,507 --> 00:23:18,757
vos hot un un azoy vi az ikh ho- m'hot mir gezogt az s- s'nisht geven keyn ACCIDENTS un s'alts durkhgeganen besholem,

322
00:23:18,882 --> 00:23:28,950
hob ikh gekrign a di sheyleray, dos heyst vu m'hot gesheylt di kartofles.

323
00:23:29,260 --> 00:23:32,994
nor dortn hot men shoyn gekokht epes andersh far di kranke,

324
00:23:32,994 --> 00:23:39,615
iz geven a por azelkhene alte, m'hot nor gekukt,

325
00:23:40,161 --> 00:23:44,374
ober m'zol nokh kenen derlebn, m'vet bafrayt vern.

326
00:23:45,628 --> 00:23:50,414
ir hot geredt vegn dem mit di andere khaveyrim in dem lager?

327
00:23:53,205 --> 00:23:58,092
ikh ken nisht, ikh veys nisht. s'hot keyner nisht,

328
00:23:58,200 --> 00:24:05,099
ikh hob a an eytse gegebn ven ikh hob gevust vu tsu geyn hintn arumet arayn tsu der kokh

329
00:24:05,099 --> 00:24:09,824
un genumen di sht- di shtiklekh fun kroyt vos m'varft avek,

330
00:24:09,824 --> 00:24:15,221
un di zakhn ikh hob zey ikh hob zey bay tog farkoyft, ikh hob gekrign a shtikl broyt.

331
00:24:15,801 --> 00:24:17,617
ikh hob mir an eytse gegebn.

332
00:24:17,893 --> 00:24:21,262
vi vayt meglekh ikh hob gekent hob ikh mikh an eytse gegebn.

333
00:24:21,454 --> 00:24:24,249
di ershte tsaytn hob ikh gehat nisht shlekht.

334
00:24:24,390 --> 00:24:30,442
der der der kukher, der der dokter, nisht keyn kukher nor a dokter,

335
00:24:30,499 --> 00:24:37,715
hot hot ge- oysgefunen az ikh ken gut opvashn a a teler, ikh ken gut opvashn a top.

336
00:24:37,840 --> 00:24:42,001
vayl fun mayn fakh muz zayn alts reyn.

337
00:24:42,295 --> 00:24:43,540
un ikh hob dos ge-

338
00:24:43,540 --> 00:24:49,522
ge- opgevashn zeyer gut. er hot mikh tsugenumen az yedn tog ven ikh aheymgekumen fun der arbet

339
00:24:49,522 --> 00:24:52,746
zol ikh araynkumen tsun im un er er vet mikh

340
00:24:52,746 --> 00:24:55,670
lozn opvashn, ikh vel krign a teler tsu esn.

341
00:24:57,432 --> 00:25:02,640
azoy hob ikh mir an eytse gegebn, azoy hob ikh gele- ibergelebt di di milkhome.

342
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:14,841
un ven hot ir gezen az es vert a bisl beser far aykh?

343
00:25:17,462 --> 00:25:24,442
neyn, dos hob ikh nisht gezen az s'vert beser. nor ikh hob gezen simonim az s-

344
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:30,990
s'vayzn zikh gute s- gute tseykhenes az m'iz v- nisht vayt.

345
00:25:31,165 --> 00:25:32,762
az s'noent di end.

346
00:25:34,877 --> 00:25:41,435
m'hot vayl fun di fun di akhtgeber oyf undz zenen antlofn a por,

347
00:25:41,948 --> 00:25:47,544
un di mit eyn mol iz avekgekumen di zelner vos hobn undz gehitn.

348
00:25:48,394 --> 00:25:53,535
ALL OF A SUDDEN. dernokh iz gekumen, un dos iz geven in letstn tog,

349
00:25:53,642 --> 00:25:55,655
in der fri zeyger tsener,

350
00:25:55,655 --> 00:26:00,785
iz gekumen di grine hitelekh, tsvey fun di grine hitlekh,

351
00:26:00,785 --> 00:26:03,524
un hobn oysgeklibn draysik yinglekh.

352
00:26:03,548 --> 00:26:08,227
mir veln kumen tsu di mayse mit di grine hitlekh a bisl shpeter.

353
00:26:08,227 --> 00:26:13,650
ikh vil a bisl mer visn vegn ayer lebn in dem lager.

354
00:26:14,061 --> 00:26:17,255
vos iz geven s'nisht geven keyn kultur,

355
00:26:17,255 --> 00:26:21,345
s'nisht geven, m'hot m'hot yedn tog far nakht

356
00:26:21,773 --> 00:26:28,196
hobn zikh a por mentshn gemuzt zikh shteln vos m'hot oy- sara m'hot oysgerufn

357
00:26:28,540 --> 00:26:36,009
un un eyner vos hot akhtung gegebn az m'zol lozn a- oyf aroyf fun vaser genug,

358
00:26:36,336 --> 00:26:41,074
un azoy iz getrunken gevorn un di un di shkotsim hobn gelakht un

359
00:26:41,074 --> 00:26:43,332
un ale tog, ale tog.

360
00:26:43,828 --> 00:26:47,552
ver hot aykh gehit, daytshn tsi ukrainisher?

361
00:26:46,512 --> 00:26:49,306
neyn daytshn. ales daytshn.

362
00:26:49,752 --> 00:26:51,686
mir hobn nisht gehat keyn ukrainer.

363
00:26:52,992 --> 00:26:55,736
ir gedenkt dem nomen funem lager?

364
00:26:54,780 --> 00:26:57,097
n- ikh gedenk nisht.

365
00:26:57,097 --> 00:26:59,044
m'hot nor gevoynt in eyn shtot.

366
00:26:59,134 --> 00:27:06,941
nor s'azoy geven der lager iz geven efsher fir kilometer tsu geyn fun dem vu m'hot gevoynt.

367
00:27:06,643 --> 00:27:08,847
fun velkhn shtot, ir gedenkt?

368
00:27:08,550 --> 00:27:11,919
yo, di ir hot dokh oyfgeshribn.

369
00:27:12,482 --> 00:27:16,458
Shtutgart, muz zayn in Shtutgart, ikh gedenk nisht genoy.

370
00:27:17,443 --> 00:27:21,470
ikh gedenk di dem nomen azoy.

371
00:27:21,696 --> 00:27:24,693
s'geven a sakh mentshn in dem lager?

372
00:27:24,362 --> 00:27:28,778
yo, di letste tsayt hobn men zikh fun andere lagern,

373
00:27:29,661 --> 00:27:33,944
zenen arayngekumen zenen geshtanen do a vokh tsi tsvey vokhn,

374
00:27:33,944 --> 00:27:37,049
un m'hot geshikt ergets andersh vu. m'hot alts

375
00:27:37,049 --> 00:27:42,058
geshikt fun, zenen arayngekumen mentshn, m'hot zey avekgeshikt ergets andersh.

376
00:27:42,317 --> 00:27:47,069
nor der dokter fun dort hot shtendik mikh in zin gehat.

377
00:27:47,464 --> 00:27:48,858
er iz geven a yid?

378
00:27:48,730 --> 00:27:49,517
NO.

379
00:27:49,607 --> 00:27:52,250
er iz nisht geven keyn yid, nor

380
00:27:52,695 --> 00:27:57,447
ikh bin geven mit im azoy bafrayndet, ikh hob oysgevashn, farshidens,

381
00:27:57,471 --> 00:28:00,632
un er hot mikh, er hot tsum bayshpil,

382
00:28:01,892 --> 00:28:05,379
a sakh mol hot er mikh farhitn az m'zol mikh nisht nemen.

383
00:28:06,904 --> 00:28:10,087
ober ir hot gearbet oyf di tsvey melokhes,

384
00:28:10,971 --> 00:28:14,495
mit di relsn un mit di tep, vashn di tep.

385
00:28:16,405 --> 00:28:24,533
di tep mit di dos iz geven epes andersh. dort hob ikh ge- dort hob ikh nisht getort zogn az ikh bin a fakhman, ikh bin a beker,

386
00:28:24,758 --> 00:28:28,805
oder a kukher oder epes andersh. dort hob ikh far keynem nisht getort zogn.

